{"channelId":"UCwHq_-4Di5X3mPe1MEOyn8Q","row":["D.K - The wildlife rescuer",132000,"In the heart of Uttarakhand's breathtaking wilderness, a dedicated wildlife rescuer on a mission to protect and save the incredible flora and fauna of this pristine region. Join us on an extraordinary journey as we follow [Dk harbola] through dense forests, rugged mountains, and untamed rivers, witnessing his unwavering commitment to wildlife conservation. \nThis video is a testament to the importance of wildlife conservation and the incredible individuals who devote their lives to safeguarding our planet's natural treasures. Join us on this unforgettable journey as we celebrate the dedication and passion of [Dk Harbola] and the incredible wildlife of Uttarakhand.\n\nDon't forget to like, share, and subscribe to our channel to support the heroes of wildlife conservation in Uttarakhand and around the world. Together, we can make a difference in preserving our planet's most precious inhabitants. #WildlifeRescue #UttarakhandWildlife #ConservationHeroes","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwHq_-4Di5X3mPe1MEOyn8Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwHq_-4Di5X3mPe1MEOyn8Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:20.935Z","channelId":"UCwHq_-4Di5X3mPe1MEOyn8Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e635e7c312a079d2c95acc2720cfa48c67e2875a6714621ca896126bca429f42","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5a06723a7edd5d9b5df7d7d620730079a5da3e0326016548337a98881bd47f4a"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwHq_-4Di5X3mPe1MEOyn8Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":132000,"raw":"132K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwHq_-4Di5X3mPe1MEOyn8Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:20.935Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant"